# Cool but Rude at level 1. Turn 3: Bot1 casts it and attacks with Ornithopter (power 0); "whenever you attack, you may
# discard a card. If you do, draw a card" discards Lightning Bolt and draws a Plains. At level 1 the class has no
# "whenever you discard" ability, so Bot2 stays at 20. Turn 5: Bot1 attacks again and chooses no card, so nothing is
# discarded and nothing is drawn (the library holds only the turn's draw less).

